        1,
        2,
        3,
        4,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The backend still decides",
      "what": "On the other modes the call reaches the backend, which must refuse calls it dislikes.",
      "why": "In testing None reached the agent (its own 401), Static Token returned 200, and an empty vault forwarded no header with a log line.",
